{
  "slug": "adversarial-review",
  "name": "Adversarial Review",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Adversarial planning and code review workflow between Claude Code and OpenAI Codex CLI. Enables iterative convergence loops where Claude creates plans/code and Codex provides critical review.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **2 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `adversarial-workflow` (This skill should be used when the user asks about \"adversarial review\", \"codex review loop\", \"plan review with…)\n- **Commands** (2): `adversarial-plan` (Create an implementation plan with adversarial review by Codex), `adversarial-review` (Run adversarial code review by Codex on current changes)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install adversarial-review@claude-community` from `bobby-beckmann/adversarial-review`.",
